      "n": "#27·34",
      "text": "This pink midi dress features a high neckline, long puffed sleeves that gather at the wrist, and a softly ruched waistline that creates a flattering silhouette. The fabric flows gently to mid-calf length with a straight skirt that moves beautifully when you walk."
    },
    {
      "n": "#145·36",
      "text": "This burgundy leather handbag has a structured rectangular shape and a sleek curved metal handle that arches over the top. Its deep wine tone complements your skin and adds richness to the softer pastel tones of your dress."
    },
    {
      "n": "#258·05",
      "text": "These ginger suede ankle boots have a classic sneaker-inspired shape with soft shearling lining peeking out from the top. They feature lace-up fronts, rounded toes, and layered rubber soles for comfortable all-day wear."
    },
    {
      "n": "#264·20",
      "text": "This red feathered belt wraps snugly around the waist with a smooth satin-like band and a cascade of soft feathers that add texture and movement to your outfit. The vibrant red hue ties together the burgundy bag and ginger boots."
    }
